(Values are engineering assumptions \(not recovered from the original model\): f0 = 85 kHz \(79-90 kHz\), L1 = L2 = 120 uH, C = 29.2 nF, P_REF = 3.3 kW, battery 300-380 V, I_pri <= 35 A, I_bat <= 12 A.) Tj
