51.05 409.52 Td
(LIMITATION: with an uncontrolled diode front end \(V_DC about 300 V\) SS frequency control alone reaches 3.3 kW inside the current limits only at high coupling \(k ~ 0.3-0.4\); low-k operation needs a regulated DC link, phase-shift control or a coil redesign.) Tj
