51.05 400.88 Td
(SAFETY: primary side is mains-referenced, resonant capacitors reach ~2.2 kV rms. Not included / not verified: EMI filter, PFC \(IEC 61000-3-2\), RCD/earth-leakage, insulation coordination, thermal design, hardware validation. Not reviewed for mains connection.) Tj
