51.05 392.24 Td
(Protection: primary OCP = I_PRI -> STM32 COMP1 -> HRTIM fault \(firmware\); secondary OVP = U11 latch fires Q5 crowbar \(SS: secondary short collapses primary current\) + OVP_FLAG; F2 fuse; charging CC/CV only via P_REF from vehicle BMS \(CAN -> Wi-Fi\).) Tj
